OL,3,AAmputee told he needs more proof for
OL,4,Ablue badge
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk County Council has insisted it
OL,7,Fis following correct procedures. But
OL,8,FWard, who lost his leg following a
OL,9,Fmedical incident on a cruise three
OL,10,Fyears ago, has been left "very
OL,11,Fdisheartened" and says he worries it
OL,12,Fwill affect his independence.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
